76:     // It is currently very tricky to keep this kind of POJO classes in sync with instances of
77:     // org.apache.flink.configuration.Configuration. Instances of Configuration are way easier to
78:     // pass, layer, merge, restrict, copy, filter, etc.
79:     // See ExecutionOptions.RUNTIME_MODE for a reference implementation. If the option is very
80:     // crucial for the API, we can add a dedicated setter to StreamExecutionEnvironment. Otherwise,
81:     // introducing a ConfigOption should be enough.
